        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Avimbi vu mu Litembeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami Daudi na aviimiliri va vandu va Levi vaatovora vi viliango via vandu va Levi ukwimilira miyinzi ju kusigamira Yahova. Yava vaali Asafu, Hemani, na Jeduzuni. Venyeka vilwaaze makuva ga Nyasaye, harara ni zinyimbu ziuvukana kandi uvukana vwi migoye kandi vikuli. Yili nilio lilohiza lia avandu vatovolwa ukwimilira lisigamira, nu lugano lwu vutumiki lwa vuli mundu yakola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avayaayi vane va Asafu vaali: Zakuri, Josefu, Nezania, na Asharela. Vaali haasi hu vwimiliri vwa Asafu, uwaporofeta amakuva ga Nyasaye lwosi lwu mwami yavalaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avayaayi sita va Jeduzuni, Gedalia, Zeri, Jeshaya, Shimei, Hashabia, na Matizia. Haasi hu vwimiliri vwa baba wavo, vilwaza makuva ga Nyasaye nu vukana, ni viimba zinyumba ziu kwizominya kandi ukusandiza Yahova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hemani yaali na vayaayi 14: Buza, Matania Uzieli, Shebueli, Jerimozi, Hanania, Hanani, Eliaza, Gidaliti, Romamuti - Ezeri, Joshibekasha, Malozi, Hoziri na Mahaziozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasaye yaaha Hemani, muporofeti wu mwami, avayaayi 14 kandi avakaana vavaga; kuli yaali niyasuuvira kunangwa aduuki kuhaana zinguru ku Hemani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vayaayi veve vosi vakuba vikuli nu vukana haasi hu vwimiliri vwa baba wavo ukuzia harara nilisigamira liu mu Litembeli. Na Asafu, Jeduzamu na Hemani vaali hasi ha malago gu mwami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
